.claude/

# Drive-import working data (scripts/drive-import/README.md) — large, regenerable from
# Drive, and the raw exports may carry more of the source school documents' content than
# belongs in git history. Only the two scripts + the generated supabase/seed_drive_*.sql
# output are committed.
scripts/drive-import/raw/
scripts/drive-import/parsed/

# Scratch previews staged into public/ for live JS verification. They are session
# artifacts, never deliverables -- one reached origin/main on 2026-09-03 because a
# broad `git add -A` during a merge resolution swept it up.
public/_tmp-*
